      "value": "  \r\n🚀 Jenkins Deployment Complete!\r\n================================\r\n  \r\nJenkins URL: http://10.72.97.219:8080\r\nSSH Access: ssh -i cloud.key rocky@10.72.97.219\r\n  \r\nNext Steps:\r\n1. Wait 5-10 minutes for Jenkins to fully initialize\r\n2. Get admin password with: ssh -i cloud.key rocky@10.72.97.219 'sudo cat /var/lib/jenkins/secrets/initialAdminPassword'\r\n3. Access Jenkins and monitor the automatic build of 'team-6-accessibility-project'\r\n  \r\nThe pipeline will automatically:\r\n- Clone your repository\r\n- Install dependencies \r\n- Run tests\r\n- Build Docker images\r\n- Deploy with docker-compose\r\n  \r\n",
